      "page_title": "Tasks Cheatsheet: Shield, Deadlines & Debugging",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "CancelledError is a **BaseException**: `except Exception` misses it",
            "Clean up in `finally` / `except CancelledError:`, then ==re-raise==",
            "Swallowing it breaks TaskGroup, timeout() and shutdown",
            "`shield(coro())` with no ref: inner task can be GC'd"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "t = create_task(commit())  # ref",
            "try:",
            "    await asyncio.shield(t)",
            "except asyncio.CancelledError:",
            "    await t; raise  # finish write"
          ],
          "note": "outer cancelled, inner t runs on"
        },
